entityDescription:
The company&rsquo;s object is:
(a) the research, design, development, manufacture, integration, operation, maintenance and commercialization of scientific, industrial and technological hardware and related software, in particular for use in terrestrial, orbital and other space environments, as well as any related biotechnological, pharmaceutical and industrial processes;
(b) the provision of research, development, testing, consulting, engineering, integration and operational services relating to hardware, software, microgravity experiments, life‑science applications in space and biomanufacturing.
